5. Detect Anomalies

Check for missing bumps by comparing expected vs. detected bumps.

Look for overlapping bumps or non-circular defects.


Missing Bumps Detection

If bumps are arranged in a grid, compare detected bump positions with expected ones.


expected_bump_positions = [(x, y) for x in range(50, 500, 50) for y in range(50, 500, 50)]
detected_positions = [(cx, cy) for cx, cy, _ in bump_data]

